WEBVTT

00:11:58.053 --> 00:12:00.327
Flicking through and saying,
"What, this is it?"

00:12:00.351 --> 00:12:01.976
(Laughter)

00:12:02.000 --> 00:12:05.319
(Applause)

00:12:05.343 --> 00:12:08.299
"You've been around
for 36 months, and this is it?"

00:12:08.323 --> 00:12:15.376
(Laughter)

00:12:15.400 --> 00:12:17.154
"You've achieved nothing -- commit.

00:12:17.178 --> 00:12:18.564
(Laughter)

00:12:18.588 --> 00:12:21.389
Spent the first six months
breastfeeding, I can see."

00:12:21.413 --> 00:12:24.072
(Laughter)

00:12:26.532 --> 00:12:29.119
See, it's outrageous as a conception.

00:12:29.143 --> 00:12:31.333
The other big issue is conformity.